DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ich grüße dich{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ich frage mich, ob dieser ewige
Regen heute auch mal aufhört...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}I wonder if it keeps on raining
because the sky is crying.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
If that's the case...
{{TAG:0007:000A:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Stop your blubbering up there!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm getting soaked to the bone,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Wieso regnet es denn dauernd?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ist da irgendetwas undicht?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Aufhören, da oben! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich werde 
patschnass, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}You'd think I wouldn't want any
part of all this mud, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I'm usually fussy, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}I know.
But I'd totally roll around in it. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}if it didn't mean I'd track mud all
over my clean floor, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Every raindrop is like a musical
note in a pretty symphony! {{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}What?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Is it just ME who feels that way?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ogni singola goccia che cade è una
nota musicale di una bella sinfonia!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Come dici...?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sto esagerando?!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Jeder Tropfen ist wie eine Note
in einer erlesenen Sinfonie!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Bezaubernd!

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ich werde klatschnass hier draußen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Manchmal wünschte
ich, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ich wäre ein Frosch...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿No podría ser así todos los días? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Con lluvia,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} humedad, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}barro...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡Es como si el mundo fuera mi
estanque privado, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}A little rain can be nice, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}I guess,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
but THIS much? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}I am so ready for
tomorrow to start, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Un poco de lluvia viene bien, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
¿pero TANTA? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Que se acabe ya
el día, por favor, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Un po' di pioggia non mi dispiace,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
ma {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}tutta quest'acqua{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}sta sciupando
i miei gerani, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

